/-- Rule 862 has the same count as Rule 798 at every stage 2^n - 1. -/
theorem a273570_r862_count_eq_798 (n : Nat) : onCount 862 (2 ^ n - 1) = onCount 798 (2 ^ n - 1) :=
  vn_twin_count VN.VB273570.tab 798 862 959 VN.VB273570.ok2 VN.VB273570.ok1 (List.all_eq_true.mp VN.VB273570.twins 862 (by decide)) _

/-- A273418 (Rule 705): %F Conjecture: a(n) = A273313(n), n>1. - R. J. Mathar, May 27 2016.
A273313 is the OEIS entry whose rule is Rule 643 (Chair C's map, read id r-mwmn9e3q-2j01ww). From the two closed forms
above, Rules 705 and 643 have the same count at stage 2^n - 1 for every n >= 2 (only n >= 2: the entries differ at n = 1). -/
theorem a273418_eq_a273313 (n : Nat) (hn : 2 ≤ n) : onCount 705 (2 ^ n - 1) = onCount 643 (2 ^ n - 1) :=
  by exact_mod_cast (a273418_formula n hn).trans (a273418_r643_formula n hn).symm

